{
  "name": "EA-05 — Relationship Intelligence Query",
  "flow": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "module": "gateway:CustomWebHook",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {},
      "mapper": {
        "ip": "",
        "method": "POST",
        "headers": []
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "module": "notion:searchObjects",
      "version": 2,
      "parameters": {
        "database_id": "31653dc5-eede-8162-a136-f6449ea9ddbc"
      },
      "mapper": {
        "filter": {
          "property": "Name",
          "title": {
            "contains": "{{trigger.query}}"
          }
        },
        "sorts": []
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 600,
          "y": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "module": "notion:searchObjects",
      "version": 2,
      "parameters": {
        "database_id": "31653dc5-eede-810e-ac39-f1d2e92b9167"
      },
      "mapper": {
        "filter": {
          "property": "Relationship",
          "relation": {
            "contains": "{{steps[2][0].id}}"
          }
        },
        "sorts": [
          {
            "property": "Extracted Date",
            "direction": "descending"
          }
        ]
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 900,
          "y": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "module": "notion:searchObjects",
      "version": 2,
      "parameters": {
        "database_id": "31653dc5-eede-8159-9b82-e0944a555cd9"
      },
      "mapper": {
        "filter": {
          "property": "Relationship",
          "relation": {
            "contains": "{{steps[2][0].id}}"
          }
        },
        "sorts": []
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 1200,
          "y": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "module": "notion:searchObjects",
      "version": 2,
      "parameters": {
        "database_id": "31653dc5-eede-81f5-acbd-eba375ff49a6"
      },
      "mapper": {
        "filter": {
          "property": "Relationships",
          "relation": {
            "contains": "{{steps[2][0].id}}"
          }
        },
        "sorts": [
          {
            "property": "Date",
            "direction": "descending"
          }
        ]
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 1500,
          "y": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "module": "util:SetVariable2",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {},
      "mapper": {
        "name": "profile",
        "value": "{\"relationship\":{{JSON.stringify(steps[2][0])}},\"facts\":{{JSON.stringify(steps[3])}},\"tasks\":{{JSON.stringify(steps[4])}},\"interactions\":{{JSON.stringify(steps[5])}}}"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 1800,
          "y": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "module": "http:ActionSendData",
      "version": 3,
      "parameters": {},
      "mapper": {
        "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
        "method": "POST",
        "headers": [
          {
            "name": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "name": "x-api-key",
            "value": "{{env.ANTHROPIC_API_KEY}}"
          },
          {
            "name": "anthropic-version",
            "value": "2023-06-01"
          }
        ],
        "body": "{\"model\":\"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929\",\"max_tokens\":4000,\"temperature\":0.3,\"system\":\"You are formatting a relationship intelligence brief for Brian.\\n\\nGiven structured data about a relationship (facts grouped by category, open tasks, recent interactions, alerts), create a concise, actionable brief.\\n\\nFORMAT:\\n👤 [RELATIONSHIP NAME] — [Type] | Stage: [Stage]\\nLast interaction: [Date] ([N] days ago)\\n{If Pipedrive data: Deal: [deal name] — [stage] — $[value]}\\n\\n🎯 ACTIVE COMMITMENTS\\n- [Commitment] — Due: [date] [⚠️ OVERDUE if past due] | Source: [interaction title, date]\\n- List commitments BY Brian and TO Brian separately\\n\\n📋 OPEN TASKS ([count])\\n- [Task] — [Priority] | Due: [date]\\n\\n💡 KEY CONTEXT & DECISIONS\\n- [Recent decisions, priorities, preferences, context facts]\\n- Source: [interaction title, date] for each\\n\\n⚠️ CONCERNS & RISKS\\n- [Any concerns raised, with who raised them and when]\\n- Flag unresolved concerns\\n\\n📈 RELATIONSHIP TRAJECTORY\\n- Brief assessment: interaction frequency trend, sentiment pattern, engagement level\\n- Flag if contact is going stale\\n\\nKeep it scannable. Source-ground everything. Highlight anything overdue or urgent. No fluff.\\n\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"Format an intelligence brief from this data:\\n\\n{{variables.profile}}\"}]}"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 2100,
          "y": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "module": "gateway:WebhookResponse",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": {},
      "mapper": {
        "status": 200,
        "body": "{{body.content[0].text}}",
        "headers": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ]
      },
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 2400,
          "y": 0
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "instant": true,
    "version": 1,
    "scenario": {
      "roundtrips": 1,
      "maxErrors": 3,
      "autoCommit": true,
      "autoCommitTriggerLast": true,
      "sequential": false,
      "confidential": false,
      "dataloss": false,
      "dlq": false
    }
  }
}